<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Waste Industries.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Waste Industries.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it initiated coeverage of Waste Industries Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown was an underwriter for Waste Industries' June 13 initial public offering.</p>
